        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for python-graphql-core fixes the following issues:\n\nChanges in python-graphql-core:\n\n- CVE-2026-75507: Fix quadratic complexity in OverlappingFieldsCanBeMerged\n  validation rule when comparing nested inline fragments. (bsc#1287830)\n- CVE-2026-75508: Count skipped comment tokens toward the parser max_tokens\n  limit to prevent memory exhaustion. (bsc#1287829)\n",
